        "text_address": "0x1465c1325",
        "label": "C++ exception"
      }
    },
    "text": "0x14035f0d5..0x14035f6f7 emits the build, Unix time, platform, faulting thread, exception, address and module, guarded access information, dump path, optional backtrace and oldest-first log. The report writer 0x14035f7c3 emits a stderr path only on success.",
    "optional_diagnostics": "0x14035ea64 skips the crashing-thread unwind and log snapshot on stack overflow. Otherwise it captures a backtrace, starts the named fault-report worker, and reads the log channel with a two-second deadline."
  },
